                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b1ff1dae-3048-436e-81dd-59a50623eec0",
                        "source_entry_id": "3f29be53-d860-319f-9779-f33fa91ec3dd",
                        "source_sense_id": "eb09112a-c55c-3df4-ae17-0074a546a747",
                        "source_sense_description": "dat iets wat normaal is vreemd wordt",
                        "target_lang_word": "amazing",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "amazing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e09963fc-58f5-3385-aaa2-2cff0df7aaac",
                                        "entry_id": "1f10c947-f31e-3c6c-894b-b1829f82e25b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of amaze"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7ff26ab-d30e-4cc1-9a0f-415eafcedf7b",
                                                "sense_id": "e09963fc-58f5-3385-aaa2-2cff0df7aaac",
                                                "text": "Falling into her uſual Trance, ſhe at that inſtant wrought their Fancies to be perſuaded of the confuſed Articulation of Multitudes met as in a Fair, converſing and making a chattering, to the amazing of them all."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa96991c-8b89-4d2e-8a7d-9544398d0b5c",
                                                "sense_id": "e09963fc-58f5-3385-aaa2-2cff0df7aaac",
                                                "text": "How many things have men found out to the amazing of one another, to the wonderment of one another, to the begetting of endless commendations of one another in the world"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "215ea8b5-170c-4849-8d44-55ad608360ea",
                                                "sense_id": "e09963fc-58f5-3385-aaa2-2cff0df7aaac",
                                                "text": "Amazing is judged relative what already exists, and Quake has the best underwater effects so far."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abb37934-3af3-4a68-b166-52c92d338e8d",
                                                "sense_id": "e09963fc-58f5-3385-aaa2-2cff0df7aaac",
                                                "text": "Reality, especially God's Reality is amazing. For instance that there is something rather than nothing is amazing. [...] Amazing is amazing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67315393-95df-440b-8dbe-406242a2b6fe",
                                                "sense_id": "e09963fc-58f5-3385-aaa2-2cff0df7aaac",
                                                "text": "The amazing is happening."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d21e328f-616f-45ab-98b9-f0c6d2b5d99f",
                                                "sense_id": "e09963fc-58f5-3385-aaa2-2cff0df7aaac",
                                                "text": "All that is impossibly amazing is considered nothing, and the impossibly amazing is considered normal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9509738-73e8-400f-a295-826b3670e8e2",
                                                "sense_id": "e09963fc-58f5-3385-aaa2-2cff0df7aaac",
                                                "text": "The amazing is that, in EXACTLY the same situation, the demo2 doesn't show this problem."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2aced267-998a-4ea3-a31e-b2b4432b11d3",
                                                "sense_id": "e09963fc-58f5-3385-aaa2-2cff0df7aaac",
                                                "text": "Everything that amazes has its method, until we notice that the amazing is not amazing, has no method."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d611aaa1-b0e8-453d-8df8-4852e53300d0",
                                                "sense_id": "e09963fc-58f5-3385-aaa2-2cff0df7aaac",
                                                "text": "Sheffield is an amazing athlete, how much of the amazing is provided from the Chemlab."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdc35f31-ca9f-4944-b416-a23bd16bd00b",
                                                "sense_id": "e09963fc-58f5-3385-aaa2-2cff0df7aaac",
                                                "text": "2006 May 16, Simon Baird, \"monkeyGTD is amazing- a few questions and suggestions\", GTD TiddlyWiki, Google goups\nCool! Of course 99% of the amazing is due to the \"powered by TiddlyWiki\" part of MonkeyGTD.. :)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "amazing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71ef85b0-8e88-3342-be5d-25b3b55057ae",
                                        "entry_id": "d9602ce3-bd1a-3561-a3cd-d97b67f1f190",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing wonder and amazement; very surprising."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "634638dd-be0d-42d5-a7c9-e074551ce959",
                                                "sense_id": "71ef85b0-8e88-3342-be5d-25b3b55057ae",
                                                "text": "“It’s been amazing, the amount of emails and congratulations,” the Snow White and the Huntsman star, 36, told Ryan Seacrest Friday on his radio show."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0bb95e1-2516-3e5b-945b-d7d59800fa1a",
                                        "entry_id": "d9602ce3-bd1a-3561-a3cd-d97b67f1f190",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Possessing uniquely wonderful qualities; very good."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f525c5d-3367-4777-8448-81b44236e615",
                                                "sense_id": "c0bb95e1-2516-3e5b-945b-d7d59800fa1a",
                                                "text": "2014, November 8, Nick McCarvel, \"Wozniacki's marathon debut was amazing, Djokovic says\", USA TODAY Sports\n\"Running a marathon is definitely an amazing experience.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe57603e-6403-4681-a0e1-9ee45b0a06b8",
                                                "sense_id": "c0bb95e1-2516-3e5b-945b-d7d59800fa1a",
                                                "text": "2014, November 6, WAAY-TV (Huntsville, AL), VIDEO: \"Sitting next to him was amazing\" says student of General Via\n\"I think it was pretty amazing that he picked our school out of a lot of schools to come speak to us about what he has done, and what our country has done, to help us gain our freedom,\" Mucci said, “sitting next to him was amazing.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7483d52c-9ba0-4ca9-ac2e-4558fff94d48",
                                                "sense_id": "c0bb95e1-2516-3e5b-945b-d7d59800fa1a",
                                                "text": "“I didn’t think I would be a fan of the swaddling, but the swaddling’s pretty amazing,” she says."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
